            "type": "text/html"
          }
        ]
      },
      "note": [
        "The types of studies included in the category Other students has changed over the years.  \r\n  \r\n1) Student grants for studies abroad were not included 1993–1994 nor 1996. \r\n  \r\n2) Advanced vocational education (KY) was included from 1997. Thus about 800 students who started in this (then new) type of education 1996 are not included. \r\n  \r\n3) For Folk High Schools students in long courses are included from 1997, but for the years 1997–1999 only partially since the data for these years only cover participants in the education initiate for unemployed (kunskapslyftet). \r\n  \r\n4) Students in the preparatory year of science and technogy in universities and university colleges are included from 1998. \r\n  \r\n5) The category Others with government financial support refer to students who have received grants from the National Board of Student Aid called SVUX,SVUXA, UBS or rekryteringsbidrag (recruitment grant) unless they are already included in an other category. As of 2024, individuals receiving study start support and transition study support who cannot be classified into other category are also included. \r\n  \r\n6) Post-graduate students with an activity rate less than 1 per cent are excluded from 2005 on. Between 2000 and 2004 students with an activity rate less than 10 per cent were excluded. \r\n  \r\n7) From 2015 Arts- and culture courses are included in Supplementary education programmes. \r\n  \r\n8) From 2016 Supplementary education programmes have been replaced by Arts- and culture courses. \r\n  \r\n9) Due to changes in the reporting system in higher education, from 2018, the previous university of students attending distance education in higher education is listed as their study municipality to a greater extent than before. Before 2018, students attending distance education mainly had the municipality where they were registered in the population listed as their study municipality (see Quality Declaration – Participation in education). \r\n  \r\n10) From 2021, contract education at universities is not included in the category Other students. \r\n  \r\n11) From 2022, new definition of students at higher vocational education. The number of students decreases with about 5 000 persons."
      ],
